assets/smartstorage/textures/block/cable.png
--------------------------------------------

Derived from the cable texture of the Logistics addon in xenondevs/Nova-Addons:

    logistics/src/main/resources/assets/textures/block/cable/basic.png
    Copyright (C) 2023 xenondevs
    GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3

It is that texture with its hue rotated; saturation, brightness and alpha are taken
from the source pixel for pixel, so it is a recolour and therefore a derivative work.
It remains under the LGPL-3.0. The transformation is reproducible from the original
by running tools/gen-cable-texture.ps1.

A verbatim copy of the licence is included at licenses/Nova-Addons-LGPL-3.0.txt.


What is NOT derived
-------------------

The rest of the generated art is synthesised rather than copied, and carries no
upstream licence:

  - the block casing and every device face (tools/gen-block-textures.ps1)
  - the menu backgrounds, which are laid out to match Nova's own geometry but are
    drawn from scratch (tools/gen-gui-textures.ps1)
  - the cable, connector and interface models (tools/gen-cable-models.ps1,
    tools/gen-hub-models.ps1)

The cable and hub models reproduce the box coordinates and per-face UV rotations that
Logistics uses, because a SmartStorage arm has to meet a Logistics-shaped arm without
a seam. Those are numerical parameters rather than expression, and LGPL-3.0 section 3
covers exactly that case.
